WEBVTT

cue0146213
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.400
The maḥloqet is an athetal of the Tora, never un-one of the Akkarim. Let me explain to you, it's a very, very, very important, and also intellectually is one of the great principles.

cue0146214
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:22.800
The thing is the following. There's many maḥloqet in the Gemaraʾ, I don't know, it goes into the thousands of maḥloqet, controversies.

cue0146215
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:29.480
and not only in the Gemaraʾ, in postal music, you know, the Ge'onim, the very little maḥloqet,

cue0146216
