cue0146289
00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:09.000
What is Minat Tora,

cue0146290
00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:10.460
that is called in Hebrew,

cue0146291
00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:12.200
that is a fundament,

cue0146292
00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:14.760
because it is written in the Tora.

cue0146293
00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:16.620
There cannot be a controversy.

cue0146294
00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:18.860
All the controversies that you have,

cue0146295
00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:20.000
