cue0147357
00:57:41.060 --> 00:57:41.860
How you Mekadesh are?

cue0147358
00:57:42.080 --> 00:57:44.260
With a peruta or with a isar?

cue0147359
00:57:44.380 --> 00:57:45.020
Or with another...

cue0147360
00:57:45.020 --> 00:57:45.560
With a dime?

cue0147361
00:57:45.680 --> 00:57:46.680
With a penny or with a dime?

cue0147362
00:57:47.060 --> 00:57:47.500
All right?

cue0147363
00:57:47.660 --> 00:57:50.180
So therefore they say that is the proof for Rambam

cue0147364
00:57:50.180 --> 00:57:51.460
that this is going to be in the Tora.

cue0147365
00:57:52.680 --> 00:57:53.040
What?

cue0147366
00:57:56.140 --> 00:57:57.220
No, no, no, no.

cue0147367
