No, no, no.

cue0147368
00:57:59.220 --> 00:58:01.800
You have a miyam? See what I mean? Yes.

cue0147369
00:58:01.800 --> 00:58:03.800
We have to take the teeth in the Shemaʿ.

cue0147370
00:58:03.800 --> 00:58:07.520
It's not even a custom. It's a nice habit. If you want to do it, do it.

cue0147371
00:58:07.520 --> 00:58:10.600
I sometimes I do it, sometimes I don't do it. Depends if I remember or I don't remember.

cue0147372
00:58:10.600 --> 00:58:12.600
You know, it's not... What?

cue0147373
00:58:12.600 --> 00:58:16.600
It's nice. Hibub ha-Mismah. I do it many times, you know.
